			shape: "gear",
			size: 1.5d,
			title: "Three levels of research",
			description: ["Every level your scholars finish is a bonus for everyone in the village, and a Town needs 3 of them, with 20 villagers and 12 finished buildings.", "", "Keep building homes and workplaces while the scholars work. Tick this when the research screen shows 3 levels done."],
