			title: "Music: a Bandstand",
			description: ["Build the Bandstand, an open bandstand with a jukebox, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding a music disc: they become the Bard, who gives the village its music. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it."],
