			y: -2.0d,
			optional: true,
			title: "Mail: a Post Office",
			description: ["Build the Post Office, a little house with a Mailbox, and sneak-right-click a villager by the mailbox holding paper: they become a Postman, who carries mail between players' mailboxes. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it."],
